   "Third, the foundation. A BS in Software Engineering from COMSATS underneath a search, social, pay-per-click and analytics stack, Google and Coursera certifications, an SEO team lead chapter at All Star Technology, and independent client projects run since 2021. The engineering degree explains the pattern across the record: marketing treated as a measurable system rather than a creative gamble.",
