   "Second, the MSMP chapter, the most unusual line in the application: more than 2.7 million dollars closed for a Quebec-based business using organic social channels alone, revenue scaled one hundred fifty percent in the first year, client retention lifted fifty percent, and a team built and trained around that engine while new locations opened on the strength of consistent client acquisition. Closing high-ticket clients without paid media is craft, not luck.",
